## Why This Is Asked
Tests depth in deploying custom ops with SavedModel and zero-downtime canary rollouts, plus cross-arch building for CPU/GPU.

## Key Concepts
- TensorFlow custom ops and savedmodel integration
- Bazel/BUILD for CPU and GPU
- custom_op_library linking
- Signature definitions in TF Serving
- Canary deployments and traffic shifting with Istio

## Code Example
